From a0cda713591d407d0745d6949840e3f83284a4a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: johnnykang101 <56775858+johnnykang101@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Mar 2026 12:36:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 110/131] feat(cd): restore CLI + web binary builds for all
 platforms (#41)

* feat(cd): add macOS desktop build job (unsigned)

Adds desktop-mac job to CD workflow using macos-latest runner.
Builds without code signing (CSC_IDENTITY_AUTO_DISCOVERY=false) and
disables notarize/dmg signing until Apple certs are available.
Uploads .dmg and .zip artifacts to the release.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

* fix(cd): disable desktop-mac job until Apple certs are available

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

* feat(ci): auto-enable squash merge on every new PR

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

* feat(cd): restore CLI + web binary builds for all platforms

Adds bun setup/install to release job and restores the
packages/opencode build step that produces cross-platform CLI
and web binaries (darwin, linux, windows) uploaded to the release.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

---------

Co-authored-by: CoBuilder CEO <ceo@cobuilder.ai>
Co-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .github/workflows/cd.yml | 19 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 19 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/cd.yml b/.github/workflows/cd.yml
index 8824ca524..5143f4902 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/cd.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/cd.yml
@@ -40,6 +40,13 @@ jobs:
         with:
           fetch-depth: 0
 
+      - uses: oven-sh/setup-bun@v2
+        with:
+          bun-version: ${{ env.BUN_VERSION }}
+
+      - name: Install dependencies
+        run: bun install --frozen-lockfile
+
       - name: Get latest CoBuilder tag
         id: latest_tag
         run: |
@@ -131,6 +138,18 @@ jobs:
             --notes-file /tmp/release-notes.md \
             --latest
 
+      - name: Build and upload CLI + web binaries
+        env:
+          OPENCODE_RELEASE: "1"
+          OPENCODE_VERSION: ${{ steps.next_version.outputs.semver }}
+          OPENCODE_CHANNEL: latest
+          COBUILDER_RELEASE_TAG: ${{ steps.next_version.outputs.tag }}
+          GH_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}
+          GH_REPO: CobuilderLabs/opencode
+        run: |
+          cd packages/opencode
+          bun run build
+
   desktop-linux:
     name: Desktop (Linux)
     needs: release
-- 
